    "detailed_description": "\u300a\u6e90\u6218\u5f79\u300bis an urban sci-fi adventure theme of 3D star traversal type MMORPG game, the game background of the cosmic space-time rupture, the source of the experiment declared a failure, the energy emergency, the source of the power of the war is bound to take place!<br><br>\u3010GamePlay\u3011<br><br>1\u30013D Unreal Engine for a Cyber Universe<br>Exquisite modeling to restore the charm of the role, the future scene to build a deep immersion, cyberpunk style world high degree of freedom to play; sci-fi style Boss, equipped with unique mechanical devices, the future of science and technology is full of sense. Combination of sci-fi cyberpunk and 3D, distinguishing the game from other major categories more recognizable.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/00bcc356a05082f2634fdfe28f4f86a6.poster.avif?t=1721292861\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/00bcc356a05082f2634fdfe28f4f86a6.webm?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/00bcc356a05082f2634fdfe28f4f86a6.mp4?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>2\u3001Hand-operated combat, experience the real battlefield<br>Delicate interactive scenes, magnificent battle effects, excellent numerical system, bring host game experience, fingertip operation, you can enter the real battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/9be8709bb11692842f452937156d3912.poster.avif?t=1721292861\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/9be8709bb11692842f452937156d3912.webm?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/9be8709bb11692842f452937156d3912.mp4?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>3\u3001Free group BOSS<br>Every player can team up to participate in the limited time event, and you can get a lot of rewards after clearing the level!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/e53290f62200ef053ad4ccd7d3ad588f.poster.avif?t=1721292861\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/e53290f62200ef053ad4ccd7d3ad588f.webm?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/e53290f62200ef053ad4ccd7d3ad588f.mp4?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>4\u3001Planet Cyber More Rides<br>The mount system is huge, and the mount skins are free to get, a cool and extraordinary experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/84494efc6c4f0b1945d6261598be36b9.poster.avif?t=1721292861\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/84494efc6c4f0b1945d6261598be36b9.webm?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/84494efc6c4f0b1945d6261598be36b9.mp4?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>5\u3001Fashion and Illusion of Martial Arts Change at will<br>Each character has a wide range of fashion and weapon shapes, which are available during the event.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/2686022f9c1f899b418b3ec749d7e571.poster.avif?t=1721292861\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/2686022f9c1f899b418b3ec749d7e571.webm?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996090/extras/2686022f9c1f899b418b3ec749d7e571.mp4?t=1721292861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
